In general, a monster will pick the piece of armour that is the best
available for that slot, where "best" means the one that will give the
greatest reduction of overall AC (considering base armour class,
enchantment, and erosion); the only special ability it takes into
account is speed boots. m_dowear_type() in worn.c is the controlling
function.

